# Passive DART dry-run fixture (merged-bus hex). No hardware involved.
# Includes: polls, short ACK, DATA (DC1/DC3), fragmented poll, CRC-invalid DATA,
# and a trailing partial frame (incomplete DATA header).
#
# Chunk boundaries in FixtureByteSource follow non-comment lines (and optional
# mid-line splits for the fragmented poll).

# Complete polls (side1 / side2)
50 20 FA
51 20 FA

# Short ACK
50 C0 FA

# Fragmented poll (one frame across three lines / chunks)
50
20
FA

# DATA: DC1 FILLING (valid CRC)
50 30 01 01 04 9E 9F 03 FA

# DATA: DC3 price + NOZIO OUT (valid CRC)
50 31 03 04 00 11 75 11 62 95 03 FA

# DATA: CRC-invalid (structurally complete; CRC nibble flipped)
50 32 01 01 01 A0 24 03 FA

# Trailing partial (interrupted final frame — incomplete DATA body)
50 30 01
